---
import backgroundHero from '../../images/heroKontak.jpg'
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden py-28 lg:py-36"
>
<!-- Background Image -->
  <img
    src={backgroundHero.src}
    alt=""
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
  />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/70"></div>
  <div
    class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 text-center text-white"
  >

    <span
      class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sm md:text-md lg:text-lg text-orange-500"
    >
      Hubungi Kami
    </span>

    <h1
      class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
    >
      Konsultasikan Kebutuhan Proyek Anda
    </h1>

    <p
      class="
        mx-auto
        mt-8
        w-[80%]
        md:max-w-2xl
        text-sm
        leading-relaxed
        md:text-md
        lg:text-lg
        text-white/80"
    >
      Konsultasikan kebutuhan audit struktur, pengurusan SLF, atau manajemen proyek konstruksi Anda bersama tim ahli bersertifikat kami sekarang.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>


